 "note": "THE MENU IS A DECLARATION, NOT A TEMPLATE. SmartPRS 2's sidebar is written out in layouts/app.blade.php: fifteen anchors, each with its icon and route hard-coded, so a customer who wants Leave above Attendance, or their own word for Employees, or the whole Payroll section hidden from managers, needs a release. Here the sidebar is this file. Each section has a label and items; each item names its route, its icon (Font Awesome), its label, and the permission it needs — and an item nobody may open is MARKED rather than removed, because a menu that silently shortens itself teaches people the product is smaller than it is. `badge` names a live count the shell fills in. SECTIONS FOLLOW SMARTPRS 2's SIDEBAR, at the owner's request: Main, Hiring & Onboarding, People, Time & Attendance, Leave, Payroll, Compensation & Claims, Statutory & Compliance, Performance & Rewards, Learning & Knowledge, HR Letters, Field Force, Communication, Reports & Analytics, Administration, Organization Setup / Configuration. An item with `module` opens that module screen (?r=m&k=…) and is marked with the module's own declared view permission; an item with `route` opens a dedicated screen. A section is kept even when every item in it is locked, so the shape of the product is the same for everybody.",
